{"seq":2,"slug":"prettier-and-formatting","title":"Prettier 与代码格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/prettier-and-formatting","wordCount":557,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"prettier-与代码格式化\">Prettier 与代码格式化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码格式化工具的核心价值不在于它选择了哪种风格，而在于它终结了关于代码风格的所有争论。Tab 还是 Space？单引号还是双引号？尾逗号还是不加？当团队采用了自动格式化工具后，这些问题都有了唯一确定的答案——工具说了算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    WRITE[编写代码] --&gt; SAVE[保存文件]&#10;    SAVE --&gt; FORMAT[自动格式化]&#10;    FORMAT --&gt; CONSISTENT[一致的代码风格]&#10;    SAVE --&gt; HOOK[Git Hook 格式化]&#10;    HOOK --&gt; CONSISTENT\">flowchart LR\n    WRITE[编写代码] --&gt; SAVE[保存文件]\n    SAVE --&gt; FORMAT[自动格式化]\n    FORMAT --&gt; CONSISTENT[一致的代码风格]\n    SAVE --&gt; HOOK[Git Hook 格式化]\n    HOOK --&gt; CONSISTENT</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"prettier-配置\">Prettier 配置</h2><p>Prettier 是前端领域最流行的 Opinionated 代码格式化工具。&quot;Opinionated&quot; 意味着它有意减少配置选项——这不是缺陷，而是设计哲学：选项越少，争论越少。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json.schemastore.org/prettierrc&quot;,&#10;  &quot;semi&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;singleQuote&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;tabWidth&quot;: 2,&#10;  &quot;useTabs&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;trailingComma&quot;: &quot;all&quot;,&#10;  &quot;printWidth&quot;: 100,&#10;  &quot;bracketSpacing&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;arrowParens&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,&#10;  &quot;endOfLine&quot;: &quot;lf&quot;,&#10;  &quot;plugins&quot;: [&quot;prettier-plugin-tailwindcss&quot;],&#10;  &quot;overrides&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;files&quot;: &quot;*.md&quot;,&#10;      &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;proseWrap&quot;: &quot;preserve&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://json.schemastore.org/prettierrc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"semi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"singleQuote\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tabWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"useTabs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trailingComma\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"printWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bracketSpacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"arrowParens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"endOfLine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier-plugin-tailwindcss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"overrides\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"proseWrap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"preserve\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"忽略配置\">忽略配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# .prettierignore&#10;dist/&#10;build/&#10;node_modules/&#10;.next/&#10;coverage/&#10;pnpm-lock.yaml&#10;*.min.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># .prettierignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dist/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>build/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.next/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coverage/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pnpm-lock.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.min.js</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"prettier-与-eslint-的关系\">Prettier 与 ESLint 的关系</h2><p>Prettier 负责代码格式（How code looks），ESLint 负责代码质量（How code works）。两者的职责需要明确分离，避免规则冲突。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Prettier 职责&#10;        P1[缩进风格]&#10;        P2[引号类型]&#10;        P3[分号策略]&#10;        P4[尾逗号]&#10;        P5[行宽控制]&#10;        P6[换行规则]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ESLint 职责&#10;        E1[未使用变量]&#10;        E2[类型安全]&#10;        E3[Hooks 规则]&#10;        E4[最佳实践]&#10;        E5[导入规范]&#10;        E6[安全检查]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Prettier 职责\n        P1[缩进风格]\n        P2[引号类型]\n        P3[分号策略]\n        P4[尾逗号]\n        P5[行宽控制]\n        P6[换行规则]\n    end\n    subgraph ESLint 职责\n        E1[未使用变量]\n        E2[类型安全]\n        E3[Hooks 规则]\n        E4[最佳实践]\n        E5[导入规范]\n        E6[安全检查]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"集成方案\">集成方案</h3><p>使用 <code>eslint-config-prettier</code> 关闭 ESLint 中与 Prettier 冲突的格式化规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// eslint.config.js&#10;import js from &#39;@eslint/js&#39;;&#10;import prettierConfig from &#39;eslint-config-prettier&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [&#10;  js.configs.recommended,&#10;  {&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;no-unused-vars&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  prettierConfig,&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// eslint.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> js </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prettierConfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-config-prettier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  js.configs.recommended,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'no-unused-vars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prettierConfig,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>推荐执行顺序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 先格式化，再 lint&#10;prettier --write .&#10;eslint --fix .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 先格式化，再 lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eslint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"biome-的格式化方案\">Biome 的格式化方案</h2><p>如果团队选择了 Biome，格式化功能已经内置，无需额外安装 Prettier。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;indentStyle&quot;: &quot;space&quot;,&#10;    &quot;indentWidth&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;lineWidth&quot;: 100,&#10;    &quot;lineEnding&quot;: &quot;lf&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;javascript&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;quoteStyle&quot;: &quot;double&quot;,&#10;      &quot;semicolons&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,&#10;      &quot;trailingCommas&quot;: &quot;all&quot;,&#10;      &quot;arrowParentheses&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,&#10;      &quot;bracketSpacing&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;json&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;trailingCommas&quot;: &quot;none&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;css&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;quoteStyle&quot;: &quot;double&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indentStyle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"space\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indentWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineEnding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lf\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"javascript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quoteStyle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"semicolons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"trailingCommas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"arrowParentheses\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"bracketSpacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"trailingCommas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"css\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quoteStyle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Biome 格式化与 Prettier 的产出差异极小（&gt;96% 兼容），且速度快一到两个数量级。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"editor-集成\">Editor 集成</h2><h3 id=\"vs-code-配置\">VS Code 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;editor.formatOnSave&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;esbenp.prettier-vscode&quot;,&#10;  &quot;[javascript]&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;esbenp.prettier-vscode&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;[typescript]&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;esbenp.prettier-vscode&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;[typescriptreact]&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;esbenp.prettier-vscode&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;[json]&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;esbenp.prettier-vscode&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;[css]&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;esbenp.prettier-vscode&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"editor.formatOnSave\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esbenp.prettier-vscode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"[javascript]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esbenp.prettier-vscode\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"[typescript]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esbenp.prettier-vscode\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"[typescriptreact]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esbenp.prettier-vscode\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"[json]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esbenp.prettier-vscode\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"[css]\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"esbenp.prettier-vscode\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"editorconfig\">EditorConfig</h3><p><code>.editorconfig</code> 为不使用 Prettier 的文件类型提供基础格式约定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"root = true&#10;&#10;[*]&#10;charset = utf-8&#10;end_of_line = lf&#10;indent_style = space&#10;indent_size = 2&#10;insert_final_newline = true&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = true&#10;&#10;[*.md]&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = false&#10;&#10;[Makefile]&#10;indent_style = tab\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>root = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>charset = utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end_of_line = lf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = space</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>insert_final_newline = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.md]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Makefile]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = tab</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-格式化策略\">Monorepo 格式化策略</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中，格式化配置应当在根目录统一管理，各个包默认继承。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"monorepo-root/&#10;├── .prettierrc              # 统一配置&#10;├── .prettierignore           # 统一忽略&#10;├── .editorconfig             # 编辑器基础配置&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   └── web/                  # 继承根配置&#10;└── packages/&#10;    └── ui/                   # 继承根配置\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>monorepo-root/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .prettierrc              # 统一配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .prettierignore           # 统一忽略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── .editorconfig             # 编辑器基础配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── web/                  # 继承根配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── ui/                   # 继承根配置</span></span></code></pre></div><p>格式化检查集成到 CI 流水线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI 中检查格式（不修改文件）&#10;npx prettier --check .&#10;&#10;# 或使用 Biome&#10;npx biome check --formatter-enabled=true .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 中检查格式（不修改文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prettier</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或使用 Biome</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --formatter-enabled=true</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"格式化的最佳实践\">格式化的最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Format on Save</td>\n<td>编辑器保存时自动格式化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pre-commit Hook</td>\n<td>提交前通过 Git Hook 确保格式化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI Check</td>\n<td>流水线中检查格式一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一工具版本</td>\n<td>通过 <code>packageManager</code> 字段锁定版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进式采用</td>\n<td>大型旧项目可按目录/文件类型逐步启用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    EDITOR[编辑器 Format on Save]&#10;    HOOK[Git Pre-commit Hook]&#10;    CI[CI 流水线检查]&#10;&#10;    EDITOR --&gt; |第一道保障| CODE[代码]&#10;    CODE --&gt; HOOK&#10;    HOOK --&gt; |第二道保障| COMMIT[Git Commit]&#10;    COMMIT --&gt; CI&#10;    CI --&gt; |最终保障| MERGE[合并代码]\">flowchart TD\n    EDITOR[编辑器 Format on Save]\n    HOOK[Git Pre-commit Hook]\n    CI[CI 流水线检查]\n\n    EDITOR --&gt; |第一道保障| CODE[代码]\n    CODE --&gt; HOOK\n    HOOK --&gt; |第二道保障| COMMIT[Git Commit]\n    COMMIT --&gt; CI\n    CI --&gt; |最终保障| MERGE[合并代码]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Prettier 的核心价值是终结代码风格争论，通过 Opinionated 设计减少配置选项。</li>\n<li>Prettier 负责格式，ESLint 负责质量——两者职责明确分离。</li>\n<li>Biome 内置格式化能力，与 Prettier 产出高度兼容，速度更快。</li>\n<li>格式化应当通过三层保障落地：编辑器自动格式化、Git Hook、CI 检查。</li>\n<li>Monorepo 中统一根目录配置，各包默认继承。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Prettier 与代码格式化","id":"prettier-与代码格式化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Prettier 配置","id":"prettier-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":3,"text":"忽略配置","id":"忽略配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Prettier 与 ESLint 的关系","id":"prettier-与-eslint-的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"集成方案","id":"集成方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Biome 的格式化方案","id":"biome-的格式化方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Editor 集成","id":"editor-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"VS Code 配置","id":"vs-code-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"EditorConfig","id":"editorconfig"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 格式化策略","id":"monorepo-格式化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"格式化的最佳实践","id":"格式化的最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ESLint 与 Biome","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/eslint-and-biome"},"next":{"title":"类型安全策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/type-safety-strategies"}}